{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Change your perspective, and the world transforms.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Dimension Ascent&quot;</strong> is a puzzle-action platformer that utilizes perspective shifts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change the way you see the world and take on unique puzzles and challenges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd39 Key Mechanics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 <strong>Perspective Rotation</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620080/extras/1479032f039133056a4a2ddb33e80120.poster.avif?t=1757586974\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620080/extras/1479032f039133056a4a2ddb33e80120.webm?t=1757586974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620080/extras/1479032f039133056a4a2ddb33e80120.mp4?t=1757586974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rotate the map to create new paths and discover hidden routes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 <strong>Perspective Shift</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620080/extras/aa12775ce8ae2f709211bdec3e3eb658.poster.avif?t=1757586974\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620080/extras/aa12775ce8ae2f709211bdec3e3eb658.webm?t=1757586974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620080/extras/aa12775ce8ae2f709211bdec3e3eb658.mp4?t=1757586974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >View the world from the eyes of another entity to solve puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 <strong>Perspective Projection</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620080/extras/759439ba62a399d2c7a7ebaecd6a8e88.poster.avif?t=1757586974\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620080/extras/759439ba62a399d2c7a7ebaecd6a8e88.webm?t=1757586974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620080/extras/759439ba62a399d2c7a7ebaecd6a8e88.mp4?t=1757586974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world in a unique way, seamlessly transitioning between 2D and 3D.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3620080?t=1757586974","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3620080?t=1757586974","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620080/68a04c7d43a5b4e33465d7a9d0ada641442efd82/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757586974","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620080/68a04c7d43a5b4e33465d7a9d0ada641442efd82/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757586974","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3817990,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Change your perspective, and the world transforms.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><stro